text.section:
Whenever notice is required to be made under the terms of this chapter, unless the context expressly and exclusively provides otherwise, it shall be disseminated as follows:

By publication once each week for two successive weeks in a newspaper of general circulation within the area to be affected by the subject of the notice;


By broadcast over one or more radio stations within the area to be affected by the subject of the notice;


By mailing to each person who has asked to receive notice; and


By such additional means as the Board deems appropriate.
